3. **Ensure Transparent Explainability:** When the AI recommends a module, it should cleanly explain *why*. (e.g., 'We recommended "De-escalation Tactics" because your recent CSAT scores indicated slight friction at the returns desk.') This transparency builds employee trust rather than resentment.

